      "image": "assets/images/01.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p01.mp3",
      "en": "China has named the nation's first Mars rover Zhu Rong.",
      "cn": "中国已将本国首台火星探测器命名为“祝融”。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s56-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p02.mp3",
      "en": "For all of us, Zhu Rong is a well-suited name that has a cultural meaning within Chinese history.",
      "cn": "对于我们所有人来说，“祝融”是一个非常合适的名字，它在中国历史中具有文化意义。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s56-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p03.mp3",
      "en": "In an ancient Chinese story, Zhu Rong had the face of a man and the body of an animal.",
      "cn": "在中国古代故事中，祝融长着人的面孔，长着兽的身体。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s56-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p04.mp3",
      "en": "He rode on two dragons.",
      "cn": "他骑着两条龙。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s56-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p05.mp3",
      "en": "When he had a big fight with Gong Gong, the god of water, Zhu Rong won.",
      "cn": "在与水神共工进行的一场大战中，祝融取得了胜利。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s56-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p06.mp3",
      "en": "But after the fight, the human world came into complete darkness.",
      "cn": "但大战过后，人间陷入了彻底的黑暗。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s56-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p07.mp3",
      "en": "Then he brought fire from heaven to the world, becoming a great hero.",
      "cn": "于是，他从天上把火种带到了人间，成了大英雄。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s56-p08-01",
      "image": "assets/images/08.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p08-01.mp3",
      "en": "Much like the stories of kung fu heroes who travel far and face many dangers,",
      "cn": "就像那些长途跋涉并面临诸多危险的功夫英雄的故事一样，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s56-p08-02",
      "image": "assets/images/08.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p08-02.mp3",
      "en": "the Mars rover went on its own adventures.",
      "cn": "这台火星探测器也踏上了自己的探险之旅。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s56-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p09.mp3",
      "en": "\"Zhu Rong is regarded as the earliest god of fire in traditional Chinese culture,\" a space official said.",
      "cn": "一位航天官员说：“祝融在中国传统文化中被视为最早的火神。”"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s56-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p10.mp3",
      "en": "\"The first Mars rover was named Zhu Rong.",
      "cn": "首辆火星探测器被命名为‘祝融’。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s56-p11-01",
      "image": "assets/images/11.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p11-01.mp3",
      "en": "The name symbolises light and hope for space exploration in our country,",
      "cn": "这个名字象征着我国太空探索的光明与希望，"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s56-p11-02",
      "image": "assets/images/11.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p11-02.mp3",
      "en": "and means to guide humans to continue exploring somewhere we've never been before.\"",
      "cn": "也意在引领人类继续探索从未涉足过的地方。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s56-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p12.mp3",
      "en": "Aboard a powerful rocket, Zhu Rong left the Earth, circled Mars for several months and landed on it.",
      "cn": "“祝融”搭载强大的火箭离开地球后，绕火星环行数月，并在火星着陆。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s56-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p13.mp3",
      "en": "Zhu Rong is like a postman in the universe, having sent back many important messages from Mars.",
      "cn": "祝融号就像一位宇宙中的邮递员，已从火星传回了许多重要信息。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s56-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p14.mp3",
      "en": "In recent years, our country has sent up the world's first quantum satellite and Chang'e-5 has made a soft landing on the moon.",
      "cn": "近年来，我国将世界上第一颗量子卫星发射升空，嫦娥五号也成功在月球上软着陆。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s56-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p15.mp3",
      "en": "Zhu Rong is another key step in our space technology achievements.",
      "cn": "祝融号是我国航天技术成就的又一个重要里程碑。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s56-p16-01",
      "image": "assets/images/16.webp",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s56-p16-01.mp3",
      "en": "We have made great progress in space technology and have built our own space station,",
      "cn": "我们在航天技术上取得了巨大进步，建成了自己的空间站，"
